{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Behold, you are pregnant.</b> When you return you will conceive — as in ״הִנֵּךְ הָרָה״ of Manoah's wife." "<b>And you shall bear a son.</b> Like וְיוֹלֶדֶת, and similar to it is ״יוֹשַׁבְתְּ בַּלְּבָנוֹן מְקֻנֶּנֶת בָּאֲרָזִים״ (Jeremiah 22)." "<b>And you shall call his name.</b> It is a command, as He says to a male: ״וְקָרָאתָ אֶת שְׁמוֹ יִצְחָק״ (Genesis 17)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:56.598295490Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}